19	 * from movbe_dump.cpp -- verified by objdump that the hot-loop bytes are
20	 * unchanged, so the 179 trigger window is preserved (per
21	 * movbe-dump-compiler-dce-root-cause: ANY hot-path change silences the
22	 * defect). The golden file is written with a per-invocation suffix
23	 * derived from the run, so concurrent/overlapping runs do not clobber.
24	 *
